+
+# Generate m17 L17 b04 written plan scene asset
+
+Generated `course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b04_written-plan.png` from the built-in image generation workflow using the requested gpt-image-2 prompt and supplied BMH doodle references.
+
+The selected candidate had the right blank document stack and clean bottom-center blue space, but the raw generation used soft gradients. I resized it to 1600 x 900 and hard-mapped it to the locked six-color course palette before saving the final PNG.
+
+## Verification
+
+- `file course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b04_written-plan.png` reports PNG image data at 1600 x 900.
+- `sips -g format -g pixelWidth -g pixelHeight course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b04_written-plan.png` reports PNG, 1600 x 900.
+- Local Pillow palette check reports exactly six RGB colors: `#000000`, `#62B3F3`, `#FF7A00`, `#FFD301`, `#FFF5C7`, and `#FFFFFF`.
+- Corner pixels and the sampled bottom-center overlay area report exact `#62B3F3`.
+- Visual inspection confirms a cream folder with three blank official document forms, clean bottom-center blue space, no people, no money, no readable paperwork, no text, no symbols, no tables, and no decorative clutter.
+- `git check-ignore -v course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b04_written-plan.png` confirms the saved asset is under the existing `course-assets/` ignore rule.

